=== DESIGN ===
internal/tesla/client_vehicle_data.go provides Client.GetVehicleData(ctx, vin, endpoints...) -> *VehicleDataResponse.
However, internal/tesla.VehicleDataResponse currently exposes no gui_settings struct; the bootstrap
package therefore depends on a narrow VehicleDataClient interface (FetchGuiSettings(ctx, vehicleID))
implemented by an adapter in a later wiring prompt. This package owns:
  - GuiSettings DTO (DistanceUnits, TemperatureUnits, TirePressureUnits, ChargeRateUnits, Now)
  - resolveUnit() mapping table for all four kinds (KindDistance/Temperature/Pressure/Charge)
  - Sentinel errors: ErrTransient, ErrUnauthorized, ErrBadGuiSettings
  - Bootstrapper.Seed(ctx, vehicleID): retry [1s, 5s] -> 3 attempts max, idempotent unithistory.Repo.Record
  - tesla_bootstrap_skipped_total{vehicle_id, reason} counter on retry exhaustion
  - effective_from = max(GuiSettings.Now, fetchedAt) - 1s buffer (UTC normalised)

